.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.CONSTRAINT-AXIS.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.constraint-axis.mk
.Nd evaluates one of PLATFORMS and TOOLCHAINS
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Internal to
.Xr mk.constraints.mk 5 ,
which includes it once per list.
It parses the entries of the list, applies them in the order loud negative,
quiet negative, positive, and reports whether the selected target is built,
skipped or an error.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Pp
It has no variables of its own for a user.
The grammar is in
.Xr mk.constraints.mk 5 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bmake-it 7 ,
.Xr mk.constraints.mk 5
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
